        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Publications: Diva, Elle\n- Companies: Millivres Ltd, Twin Media Group\n- People: Frances Williams, Silke Bader, Linda Riley, Pierre Lazareff, Hélène Gordon\n- Topics: fashion, beauty, health, entertainment\n\nFacts:\n- Elle was founded in 1945 by Pierre Lazareff and his wife Hélène Gordon.\n- Diva was launched in March 1994 by Millivres Ltd under the editorship of Frances Williams.\n- Diva is now published by Twin Media Group, which is owned by Silke Bader and Linda Riley.\n- Elle is a worldwide lifestyle magazine of French origin that focuses on fashion, beauty, health, and entertainment.\n- Elle is the world's best-selling fashion magazine.",
